# Two apps, never swap files

This folder contains two independent products. Never overwrite one with the other. Never copy one `index.html` onto the other.

1. **Chat «Джой»** — `/index.html` plus `joy-avatar.jpg` and `joy-avatar-male.jpg`. Edit only these when the user talks about the companion, chat, calls, profile, night mode.
2. **Сайт Joy Style Nails** — `/nails/` (`nails/index.html`, `nails/css/`, `nails/js/`, `nails/images/`). Edit only this tree when the user talks about the manicure studio website.
3. **Сайт фитнес-клуба ONYX** — `/fitness/index.html`. Edit only this file when the user talks about the fitness club landing page.
4. **Сайт психолога** — `/psychologist/` (`psychologist/index.html`, `psychologist/css/`, `psychologist/js/`). Edit only this tree when the user talks about the psychologist landing page.
5. **Сайт такси NORD TAXI** — `/taxi/` (`taxi/index.html`, `taxi/css/`, `taxi/js/`). Edit only this tree when the user talks about the taxi service website.
6. **Сайт репетитора** — `/tutor/` (`tutor/index.html`, `tutor/css/`, `tutor/js/`). Edit only this tree when the user talks about the tutor landing page.

Do not merge them. Do not delete one to make room for the other. If several need changes, change each in its own files.
